                  "options": {
                    "html_content": {
                      "name": "Custom HTML Content",
                      "type": "html_content",
                      "default_value": "",
                      "value": "<p>Direct Connection has your modern Dodge Challenger and Charger covered for factory street, strip and track performance parts developed by SRT engineers and backed by a Mopar warranty for peace of mind.</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2 test\">\n        \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n        <figure>\n            <a href=\"modern-performance/stage-kits\">\n                <img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rparts-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/6f87c75737bcc72b4674a498139b574d/design/stage-kits.png\" alt=\"Stage Kits\">\n                <figcaption>Stage Kits</figcaption>\n            </a>\n        </figure>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n        <figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/brakes\">\n                <img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rparts-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/968fb7a4242e855a91e9c9141892b67d/design/mp-brakes.jpg\" alt=\"Brakes\">\n                <figcaption>Brakes</figcaption>\n            </a>\n        </figure>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n        <figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/drivetrain\">\n                <img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rparts-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/968fb7a4242e855a91e9c9141892b67d/design/drivetrain.jpg\" alt=\"Shifter\">\n                <figcaption>Drivetrain</figcaption>\n            </a>\n        </figure>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n        <figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/engine-parts\">\n                <img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rp-dev-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/b8f5830bcf448305c8c7aaf17d23ed8a/design/mp-engine-parts.jpg\" alt=\"Engine Parts\">\n                <figcaption>Engine Parts</figcaption>\n            </a>\n        </figure>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n        <figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/exhaust\">\n                <img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rparts-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/968fb7a4242e855a91e9c9141892b67d/design/exhaust.jpg\" alt=\"Exhaust System\">\n                <figcaption>Exhaust</figcaption>\n            </a>\n        </figure>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n        <figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/exterior-accessories\">\n                <img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rparts-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/968fb7a4242e855a91e9c9141892b67d/design/mp-exterior-accessories.jpg\" alt=\"Headlight for Exterior Accessories\">\n                <figcaption>Exterior Accessories</figcaption>\n            </a>\n        </figure>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n\t\t<figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/intake-and-air\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rparts-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/968fb7a4242e855a91e9c9141892b67d/design/mp-intake-air.jpg\" alt=\"Intake and Air\">\n                <figcaption>Intake & Air</figcaption>\n            </a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n        <figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/interior-accessories\">\n                <img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rp-dev-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/b8f5830bcf448305c8c7aaf17d23ed8a/design/mp-interior-accessories.jpg\" alt=\"Interior Gauges\">\n                <figcaption>Interior Accessories</figcaption>\n            </a>\n        </figure>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\">\n\t\t<figure>\n            <a href=\"/modern-performance/suspension\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"img-responsive w-100\" src=\"https://rparts-sites.s3.amazonaws.com/968fb7a4242e855a91e9c9141892b67d/design/suspension.jpg\" alt=\"Suspension\">\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Suspension</figcaption>\n      